# The codebase is LF-only (see CLAUDE.md; the diff-engine and merge-model text
# is strictly LF, EOL handling lives at the host boundary). Force LF on checkout
# on every platform so a Windows runner never hands CRLF-normalized source to
# the LF-assuming engines or the source-scanning tests. git auto-detects binary
# files and leaves them byte-for-byte untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
